  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Aug 4, 2026 at 12:06 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Bathinda: The All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS), Bathinda, has signed a <a href=\"/tag/memorandum+of+understanding+%28mou%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">memorandum of understanding (MoU)</a> with the Indian Institute of Technology (IIT), Indore, to promote <a href=\"/tag/healthcare+innovation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">healthcare innovation</a>.The MoU aims to establish a collaborative framework for <a href=\"/tag/interdisciplinary+research\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">interdisciplinary research</a>, <a href=\"/tag/medical+technology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">medical technology</a> innovation, <a href=\"/tag/technology+translation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">technology translation</a> and capacity building.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The collaboration is expected to combine the clinical expertise of <a href=\"/tag/aiims+bathinda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AIIMS Bathinda</a> with the engineering capabilities of <a href=\"/tag/iit+indore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IIT Indore</a> to accelerate the development of innovative, affordable and patient-centric healthcare technologies.The partnership will facilitate collaborative research, prototype development, <a href=\"/tag/intellectual+property+%28ip%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">intellectual property (IP)</a> generation, technology commercialisation, faculty and student exchanges, and joint innovation initiatives aimed at addressing real-world healthcare challenges.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The MoU was formally signed under the leadership of <a href=\"/tag/dr+ratan+gupta\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dr Ratan Gupta</a>, executive director of AIIMS Bathinda, and <a href=\"/tag/prof+suhas+joshi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prof Suhas Joshi</a>, director of IIT Indore.Addressing the gathering, Dr Gupta emphasised the importance of interdisciplinary collaboration among clinicians, researchers and engineers to develop innovative and affordable healthcare technologies.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Echoing these views, Prof Joshi reiterated IIT Indore’s commitment to working closely with AIIMS Bathinda to promote healthcare innovation.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                    \n\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Aug 4, 2026 at 12:06 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Aug 4, 2026 at 12:06 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store